<p>
  Hi <%= @user.display_login %>,
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3 tmp-mt-3">
  Your <%= Copilot.individual_product_name %> plan expires in one month and won't renew automatically. We want to make sure you have time to decide what's next.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  As you may know, GitHub is retiring annual Copilot plans as part of the move to usage-based billing. When your plan ends, your account will transition to Copilot Free, which you can continue using at no cost.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3"><strong>What we recommend</strong></p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  To keep getting new models, features, and the full agentic Copilot experience, we recommend switching to a Copilot Pro or Pro+ monthly plan. If you switch before your annual plan expires, you'll receive prorated credits for the remaining value of your subscription that can be used throughout the lifetime of your Copilot subscription.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  &bull; Copilot Pro: $<%= Copilot::COPILOT_PRO_MONTHLY_BASE_PRICE %>/month (see <%= link_to "pricing page", "https://github.com/features/copilot/plans" %> for more plan details and current pricing)<br>
  &bull; Copilot Pro+: $<%= Copilot::COPILOT_PRO_PLUS_MONTHLY_BASE_PRICE %>/month (see <%= link_to "pricing page", "https://github.com/features/copilot/plans" %> for more plan details and current pricing)
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  Code completions and next edit suggestions remain included in all plans and don't consume AI credits.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3"><strong>Next steps</strong></p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  &bull; Switch to monthly or manage your plan: <%= link_to @settings_user_billing_path, @settings_user_billing_path %><br>
  &bull; Learn more about plan options: <%= link_to Copilot::COPILOT_FOR_INDIVIDUALS_BILLING_DOCUMENTATION, Copilot::COPILOT_FOR_INDIVIDUALS_BILLING_DOCUMENTATION %><br>
  &bull; Read the billing documentation: <%= link_to Copilot::COPILOT_BILLING_DOCUMENTATION, Copilot::COPILOT_BILLING_DOCUMENTATION %><br>
  &bull; Read the blog post: <%= link_to "GitHub Copilot is moving to usage-based billing", "https://github.blog/news-insights/company-news/github-copilot-is-moving-to-usage-based-billing/" %>
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  We appreciate your patience as we build a more sustainable Copilot for everyone.
</p>

<p class="tmp-mb-3">
  The GitHub Team
</p>
